ded, and then apply the label to the module. Remove the serial number label from the module, and then attach it to the project documentation. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Connect the field wires. See “Wiring” below. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Using the self-tapping screw, attach the wall plate to the module. See Figure 1. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="457200" indent="-457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="170000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="600"/></a:spcBef><a:buFont typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:buAutoNum type="arabicPeriod"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Using the four machine screws, attach the wall plate and module to the electrical box.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="1856678492"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>